---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About SolveSteps" description="Learn about SolveSteps and our mission to help people solve real-life situations with practical, step-by-step tools.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">About SolveSteps</h1>

    <div class="space-y-8">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Our Mission</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          SolveSteps was created to help people navigate real-life challenges with confidence and clarity. We believe that everyone has the ability to solve their problems—they just need the right tools and guidance.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          Whether you're moving apartments, overwhelmed at work, trying to build better habits, or tackling a big project, our interactive tools help you break down complex situations into manageable steps.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">How We Help</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          We provide three core tools designed to work together:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-700">
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">☑️</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Checklist Builder:</strong> Break situations into actionable steps you can track and complete.
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">📅</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Weekly Planner:</strong> Organize your week with focus areas and daily actions.
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">🔄</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Routine Builder:</strong> Design and time custom routines that fit your life.
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Our Principles</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-lg">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Free & Accessible</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">No subscriptions, no paywalls. Everyone deserves access to tools that help them succeed.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-green-50 p-4 rounded-lg">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Private & Secure</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Your data stays on your device. We never collect, track, or sell your information.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-orange-50 p-4 rounded-lg">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Simple & Practical</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">No jargon. No fluff. Just straightforward tools that actually work in real life.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-purple-50 p-4 rounded-lg">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Honest & Transparent</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">We're upfront about what our tools can and cannot do. No misleading promises.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Disclaimer</h2>
        <div class="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 p-4 rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700">
          <p class="mb-2">
            <strong>Important:</strong> SolveSteps provides guidance and organizational tools only. Our tools are designed to help you organize your thoughts and create action plans, but they are not substitutes for professional advice.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-2">
            For situations requiring professional guidance—such as mental health challenges, medical concerns, legal matters, or financial planning—please consult with a qualified professional.
          </p>
          <p>
            SolveSteps is provided as-is without any warranties. Use these tools at your own discretion and judgment.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Questions?</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          Have feedback, suggestions, or need help? We'd love to hear from you.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block px-6 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-700 transition">
          Get in Touch
        </a>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
